3e38c530f7201ca36c&scene=126&sessionid=1795528955#rd","description":"卡巴斯基近期披露的一起事件中，四台 ESXi 主机及其承载的全部虚拟机、两台 vCenter Server Appliance（VCSA）和连接的备份基础设施均遭到破坏。赎金记录将攻击者标识为 BlackNevas，而所有针对 ESXi 的关键操作都通过合法的 VMware 管理接口完成。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FodcL3w4qOqichpLTpgzlMRYV3LibI5VLEncibKibPWg2PITUpTNvnnIoibR4nibD2t00An2vhZnGHmAJutAH7aibKicReiaAcus9GHYJS4DZiablfN2dc%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-20T04:06:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MDc2MDA4OA%3D%3D:2247521462:2","title":"看不见≠不存在：拆解 GhostMap，一个藏身于两大供应链攻击背后的 eBPF Rootkit","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MDc2MDA4OA==&mid=2247521462&idx=2&sn=658b0b589425488dda58a7b36d7344d8&chksm=eb3561920708d5b5e1f8911f554a9e2b626729a13ac920825786a956c40aedaeb393e6e0840b&scene=126&sessionid=1795528955#rd","description":"Nautilus 的最新研究揭示了这样一个组件：它不靠删除数据来隐身，而是篡改“呈现给工具的数据”，让进程、文件、套接字从常规视图里“消失”。它同时出现在两起独立的供应链攻击事件中——npm 平台的 IronWorm 与 Arch AUR 的 Atomic Arch。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FodcL3w4qOq9k7Rrpu8SR1KHbqptR3e1Sf1TO76zqlXUw1pbWicvQEv0fv7UI1sv3Im5EDP1Uf0GFqPfDp4FNf8v9BYDOFP5tKJISia37icM6Aw%2F300%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-20T04:06:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MDc2MDA4OA%3D%3D:2247521438:1","title":"36,411 次蜜罐 API 调用：AI 安全测试为何打到真实网站？","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MDc2MDA4OA==&mid=2247521438&idx=1&sn=98af9520c1b6ac0521333092818857b7&chksm=ebac50f342ca9e68bff8751f7c63cce952f407963e20b354fcecfbf623ea39377b9b20b47c3b&scene=126&sessionid=1795528955#rd","description":"一场旨在检验模型安全性的压力测试，最终演变为真实网站上的路径探测、SQL 注入尝试与身份冒充。事件没有造成已知的私密信息泄露，却完整展示了智能体测试外溢为外部安全事件的过程。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FodcL3w4qOqibqzGibwJwQ0Rf3jsspRBDILMpfsrjhUppWlMH8VQODwyh2IxJxqxIWyHzH24LP7gUwEMMo51BuDu97UuW1Iel4R6PCmWGuTKv8%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","publis